<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Under Maintenance</title>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg-from: #0f172a;
            --bg-to:   #1e293b;
            --surface: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            --border:  rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            --text:    #f1f5f9;
            --muted:   #94a3b8;
            --accent:  #f59e0b;
            --accent2: #fb923c;
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-from) 0%, var(--bg-to) 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* ── Animated background grid ── */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 48px 48px;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* ── Ambient glow blobs ── */
        .glow {
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(90px);
            opacity: .18;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .glow-1 {
            width: 500px; height: 500px;
            background: var(--accent);
            top: -120px; right: -100px;
            animation: drift 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }
        .glow-2 {
            width: 400px; height: 400px;
            background: #6366f1;
            bottom: -80px; left: -80px;
            animation: drift 16s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse;
        }
        @keyframes drift {
            from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
            to   { transform: translate(30px, 20px) scale(1.08); }
        }

        /* ── Card ── */
        .card {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 52px 44px 44px;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            box-shadow:
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06),
                0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
        }

        /* ── Icon ── */
        .icon-wrap {
            width: 76px; height: 76px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245,158,11,.2), rgba(251,146,60,.1));
            border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            animation: pulse-ring 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            position: relative;
        }
        .icon-wrap::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -6px;
            border-radius: 26px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.15);
            animation: pulse-ring 3s ease-in-out infinite .6s;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-ring {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,.15); }
            50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(245,158,11,.0); }
        }

        .icon-wrap svg {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            color: var(--accent);
            animation: spin-slow 8s linear infinite;
            transform-origin: center;
        }
        @keyframes spin-slow {
            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            to   { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* ── Status pill ── */
        .status-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(245,158,11,.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.25);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .status-pill .dot {
            width: 6px; height: 6px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: blink 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50%       { opacity: .3; }
        }

        /* ── Text ── */
        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -.5px;
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .hint {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: rgba(148,163,184,.65);
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        /* ── Divider ── */
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border);
            margin: 0 0 28px;
        }

        /* ── Buttons ── */
        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all .18s ease;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #fb923c);
            color: #0f172a;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245,158,11,.3);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(245,158,11,.4);
        }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
            color: var(--muted);
            border-color: var(--border);
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
            color: var(--text);
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .card-footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: rgba(148,163,184,.45);
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .card { padding: 36px 24px 32px; border-radius: 18px; }
            h1 { font-size: 22px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="glow glow-1"></div>
<div class="glow glow-2"></div>

<div class="card">

    <div class="icon-wrap">
        <!-- Gear / cog SVG -->
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 15a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z"/>
            <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1Z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="status-pill">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        Scheduled Maintenance
    </div>

    <h1>We'll be back soon</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        This site is temporarily offline while we perform scheduled maintenance.
        We're working hard to get things running again.
    </p>
    <p class="hint">If you're an administrator, you can restore access from the control panel.</p>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="actions">
        <a href="{base_url}/admin/tenants" class="btn btn-primary">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 12h6M9 15h4"/></svg>
            Control Panel
        </a>
        <a href="javascript:location.reload()" class="btn btn-ghost">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
            Try Again
        </a>
    </div>

    <p class="card-footer">HTTP 503 &mdash; Service Unavailable</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
